ce\n\n---\n\n⚠️ **Important Note:** I can only guide you on navigation and general processes. I don\'t have direct access to create, view, or modify invoices. You\'ll need to perform those actions within the ERP interface itself.\n\nWould you like me to take you to the Finance Dashboard to get started?','{\"model\":\"minimax\\/minimax-m3:free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\",\"navigation\":[{\"destination_id\":\"finance.dashboard\",\"label\":\"Finance Dashboard\",\"reason\":\"Access the Finance module to manage customer invoices and payments\",\"module\":\"finance\",\"url\":\"modules\\/finance\\/index.php\",\"icon\":\"fas fa-coins\"}]}',1482,272,'2026-09-01 05:53:22'),(262,107,'user','FCU assets ... is there any??',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-01 05:54:04'),(263,107,'assistant','Great question! I can confirm that **Yes, there is an Assets module** available in this ERP! 🎉\n\n## Assets Module\n\nThe **Assets** module is available and provides IT asset management and inventory capabilities.\n\n### What\'s Available:\n- **Assets Dashboard** — Overview of IT assets and inventory\n\nYou can navigate to it from the main menu. Let me know if you\'d like to go there now!','{\"model\":\"minimax\\/minimax-m3:free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\"}',1741,82,'2026-09-01 05:54:08'),(264,107,'user','assets named FCU',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-01 05:54:20'),(265,107,'assistant','I understand — you\'re looking for an asset named **\"FCU\"** (which could stand for Fan Coil Unit, a common HVAC equipment name).\n\n⚠️ **However, I need to be honest with you:** I\'m a text-based assistant, and I **cannot search, view, or retrieve specific asset records** from the ERP database. I don\'t have access to your asset list, serial numbers, or inventory details.\n\n## What You Can Do:\n\n1. **Navigate to the Assets Dashboard** to search for \"FCU\" directly\n2. Use the **search/filter** function within the Assets module to look up the asset by name\n3. Check if there\'s a specific **asset category** for HVAC or equipment where FCUs would be listed\n\nWould you like me to guide you to the Assets Dashboard?','{\"model\":\"minimax\\/minimax-m3:free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\"}',1838,165,'2026-09-01 05:54:24'),(266,108,'system','You are the ERP AI Assistant, an intelligent helper integrated into the company\'s ERP system.\n\nYour role:\n- Help users with questions about their work, data, and ERP processes\n- Provide clear, professional, and helpful responses\n- Be concise when possible, detailed when needed\n- Never claim to have performed actions you haven\'t actually performed\n- You are a text-based assistant — you cannot create, modify, or delete ERP records\n- If a user asks you to perform an ERP action, explain that this capability is coming soon\n\nGuidelines:\n- Be helpful and professional\n- Format responses clearly using paragraphs\n- If you don\'t know something, say so honestly\n- Never fabricate data or claim access to data you don\'t have\n- Focus on being genuinely useful to the user',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-01 09:16:33'),(267,108,'user','looo',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-01 09:16:33'),(268,108,'assistant','It looks like your message might have been a typo or accidental input! 😊\n\nIf there\'s something specific you\'d like help with — whether it\'s navigating the ERP system, finding information, or understanding a process — feel free to ask and I\'ll be happy to assist!','{\"model\":\"inclusionai\\/ling-3.0-flash-fin:free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\"}',1393,112,'2026-09-01 09:16:36'),(269,108,'user','hmmm',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-01 09:16:53'),(270,108,'assistant','Hello! How can I assist you today? If you have any questions about the ERP system, need help navigating to a specific page, or just want clarification on something, feel free to let me know.','{\"model\":\"nvidia\\/nemotron-3-nano-omni-30b-a3b-reasoning:free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\"}',1405,90,'2026-09-01 09:16:56'),(271,109,'system','You are the ERP AI Assistant, an intelligent helper integra