,'user','guide me to procurement',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 12:12:56'),(309,118,'assistant','Sure! To start working in Procurement, you can go to the **Procurement Dashboard** to see an overview of all procurement activities.\n\n**Navigation suggestion**:  \n```json\n\n```','{\"model\":\"openai\\/gpt-oss-20b\",\"provider\":\"nvidia_nim\",\"navigation\":[{\"destination_id\":\"procurement.dashboard\",\"label\":\"Procurement Dashboard\",\"reason\":\"Central hub for all procurement activities\",\"module\":\"procurement\",\"url\":\"modules\\/procurement\\/dashboard\\/index.php\",\"icon\":\"fas fa-chart-pie\"}],\"request_id\":136,\"request_key\":\"req_904d38941d1c6c6d\"}',2748,140,'2026-09-02 12:13:01'),(310,118,'user','generate me a report on assets',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 12:13:30'),(311,118,'assistant','I can’t run a report directly, but I can guide you to where you can view or create one.\n\n**1️⃣ View the Asset inventory**  \nThe most up‑to‑date list of all company assets is displayed on the *Assets Dashboard* (IT asset management).  \nFrom there you can filter, sort, and export the table for a quick snapshot or a custom export.\n\n**2️⃣ Create a custom asset report**  \nIf you need a more detailed, drill‑down or scheduled report (e.g., asset depreciation, allocation by department, maintenance history), you’ll want to use the *Reports & Analytics* module.  \nThere you can:\n\n* Browse existing templates – you may find a pre‑built “Asset Overview” or “Asset Allocation” report.  \n* Build a new report – use the report builder to choose assets, metrics, and filters.  \n* Schedule the report for automated delivery.\n\n---\n\n### Navigation Suggestions\n```json\n\n```\n\nFeel free to click the links or let me know if you’d like help building a specific report (e.g., by department, by cost center, or with depreciation).','{\"model\":\"openai\\/gpt-oss-20b\",\"provider\":\"nvidia_nim\",\"navigation\":[{\"destination_id\":\"assets.dashboard\",\"label\":\"Assets Dashboar