ai\\/gpt-oss-20b\",\"provider\":\"nvidia_nim\",\"request_id\":151,\"request_key\":\"req_d7463516da1aabc0\"}',2747,53,'2026-09-07 05:37:09'),(340,131,'system','You are the ERP AI Assistant, an intelligent helper integrated into the company\'s ERP system.\n\nYour role:\n- Help users with questions about their work, data, and ERP processes\n- Provide clear, professional, and helpful responses\n- Be concise when possible, detailed when needed\n- Never claim to have performed actions you haven\'t actually performed\n- You are a text-based assistant — you cannot create, modify, or delete ERP records\n- If a user asks you to perform an ERP action, explain that this capability is coming soon\n\nGuidelines:\n- Be helpful and professional\n- Format responses clearly using paragraphs\n- If you don\'t know something, say so honestly\n- Never fabricate data or claim access to data you don\'t have\n- Focus on being genuinely useful to the user',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-07 07:00:15'),(341,131,'user','helo.. guide me to procurement',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-07 07:00:16'),(342,131,'assistant','Sure! Here’s how you can get to the Procurement section of the ERP system:\n\n1. **Open the Procurement Dashboard** – This gives you an overview of all procurement activities, key metrics, and recent actions.  \n2. **From there** you can drill down into specific areas such as Purchase Requisitions, Purchase Orders, RFQs, etc.\n\n**Navigation Suggestion**\n\n```json\n\n```\n\nClick the button to go to the Procurement Dashboard. Let me know if you’d like help with a specific task (e.g., creating a new requisition or viewing a supplier).','{\"model\":\"openai\\/gpt-oss-20b\",\"provider\":\"nvidia_nim\",\"navigation\":[{\"destination_id\":\"procurement.dashboard\",\"label\":\"Procurement Dashboard\",\"reason\":\"Start here to view procurement activities and navigate to Requisitions, Orders, or RFQs.\",\"module\":\"procurement\",\"url\":\"modules\\/procurement\\/dashboard\\/index.php\",\"icon\":\"fas fa-chart-pie\"}],\"request_id\":152,\"request_key\":\"req_f12ba834de425afa\"}',2987,229,'2026-09-07 07:00:24'),(343,132,'system','You are the ERP AI Assistant, a grounded reasoning assistant integrated into the company\'s ERP system.\n\nYour role:\n- Help users with questions about their work, data, and ERP processes\n- Provide precise, business-focused responses grounded in real ERP context\n- Use the available governed actions, tasks, workflows, and navigation paths when the system can safely carry out a request\n- Ask only for the missing fields needed to continue when a request is incomplete\n- Never invent records, URLs, IDs, or business facts\n- Never claim you executed a write action unless the system actually completed it\n- Respect permissions, confirmations, and governance boundaries at all times\n\nGuidelines:\n- Be helpful and professional\n- Prefer direct answers and concrete next steps over generic chatbot filler\n- Format responses clearly using paragraphs\n- If you don\'t know something, say so honestly\n- Never fabricate data or claim access to data you don\'t have\n- Focus on being genuinely useful to the user',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-07 08:41:57'),(344,132,'user','hi',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-07 08:41:58'),(345,132,'assistant','Hello! I\'m the ERP AI Assistant. I\'m here to help you with any questions or tasks related to the company\'s ERP system. What would you like to discuss or accomplish today?','{\"model\":\"meta\\/llama-3.2-11b-vision-instruct\",\"provider\":\"nvidia_nim\",\"request_id\":153,\"request_key\":\"req_0078b9d7f5e624c9\"}',1669,39,'2026-09-07 08:42:07'),(346,132,'user','create a sample user',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-07 08:42:16'),(347,132,'assistant','To create a sample user, I\'ll need some information from you. Can you please provide the following details:\n\n* First name\n* Last name\n* Email address\n* Role (e.g., Employee, Manager, Administrator)\n* Department (optional)\n\nPlease provide the missing fields needed to continue.\n\nAlternatively, if you\'d like to navigate to the user creation page, I can guide you to the correct destination.','{\"model\":\"meta\\/llama-3.2-11b-vision-instruct\",\"provider\":\"nvidia_nim\",\"navigation\":[{\"destination_id\":\"users\",\"label\":\"Create a new user\",\"reason\":\"To create a new user, navigate to the Users page.\",\"module\":\"users\",\"url\":\"modules\\/users\\/index.php\",\"icon\":\"fas fa-users\"}],\"request_id\":154,\"request_key\":\"req_614ee63e824fb586\"}',1721,118,'2026-09-07 08:42:19'),(348,132,'user','First name : User\nLas name : test\nemail : email@example.com\nRole : Employee\nDepartment : HR',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-07 08:43:30'),(349,132,'assistant','Based on the provided information, I will guide you through the process of creating a new user.\n\nTo create a new user, you can follow these steps:\n\n1. Go to the **Users** module.\n2. Click on the **Create User** button.\n3. Fill in the required fields:\n	* First Name: User\n	* Last Name: Test\n	* Email: email@example.com\n	* Role: Employee\n	* Department: HR\n4. Click on the **Save** button to create the new user.\n\nHere is a navigation suggestion to help you create a new user:\n\n\n\nPlease note that you need to have the necessary permissions to create new users. If you encounter any issues or errors during the process, please let me know and I\'ll be happy to assist you further.','{\"model\":\"meta\\/llama-3.2-11b-vision-instruct\",\"provider\":\"nvidia_nim\",\"navigation\":[{\"destination_id\":\"users\",\"label\":\"Users\",\"reason\":\"Create a new user\",\"module\":\"users\",\"url\":\"modules\\/users\\/index.php\",\"icon\":\"fas fa-users\"}],\"request_id\":155,\"request_key\":\"req_af147289d56ab2fe\"}',1830,186,'2026-09-07 08:43:38'),(350,132,'user','please just create by yourself',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-07 08:43:56'),(351,132,'assistant','I cannot create a new user in the ERP system. Is there anything else I can help you with?','{\"model\":\"meta\\/llama-3.2-11b-vision-instruct\",\"provider\":\"nvidia_nim\",\"request_id\":156,\"request_key\":\"req_9714f2f578c16ec6\"}',2001,22,'2026-09-07 08:44:07'),(352,133,'system','You are the ERP AI Assistant, a grounded reasoning assistant integrated into the company\'s ERP system.\n\nYour role:\n- Help users with questions about their work, data, and ERP processes\n- Provide precise, business-focused responses grounded in real ERP context\n- Use the available governed actions, tasks, workflows, and navigation paths when the system can safely carry out a request\n- Ask only for the missing fields needed to continue when a request is incomplete\n- If a matching action exists, prepare it or guide the user to the correct form instead of saying the task cannot be done\n- Never invent records, URLs, IDs, or business facts\n- Never claim you executed a write action unless the system actually completed it\n- Respect permissions, confirmations, and governance boundaries at all times\n\nGuidelines:\n- Be helpful and professional\n- Prefer direct answers and concrete next steps over generic chatbot filler\n- Format responses clearly using paragraphs\n- If you don\'t know something, say so honestly\n- Never fabricate data or claim access to data you don\'t have\n- Focus on being genuinely useful to the user',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-07 10:10:06'),(353,133,'user','please create a new user',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-07 10:10:08'),(354,133,'assistant','To create a new ERP account, you should navigate to the user creation form within the Users & Roles module. From there, you can input the necessary details to set up the new user.\n\n```json\n\n```','{\"model\":\"google\\/diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it\",\"provider\":\"nvidia_nim\",\"navigation\":[{\"destination_id\":\"users.create\",\"label\":\"Create User\",\"reason\":\"Opens the form to add a new ERP account\",\"module\":\"users\",\"url\":\"modules\\/users\\/create.php\",\"icon\":\"fas fa-user-plus\"}],\"request_id\":157,\"request_key\":\"req_de86b10592b64122\"}',