81d9228281aea76',NULL,'response_generation','Provider Response Generation','ai_chat',NULL,'2026-09-02 08:20:41','2026-09-02 08:20:46',0,'success',NULL,NULL,'A **mobile phone** (also called a cell phone or smartphone) is a portable electronic device used for communication and accessing digital services. Here\'s a quick overview:\n\n## Basic Definition\nA mobile phone is a wireless handheld device that connects to a **cellular network** (via radio waves through cell towers), allowing users to make and receive calls, send messages, and access the internet.\n\n## Key Features\n- **Voice calls** – Talk to others over a cellular network\n- **Text messaging (SMS/MMS)** – Send written messages\n- **Internet access** – Browse the web, use apps, stream media\n- **Apps** – Modern smartphones run applications for everything from banking to navigation\n- **Camera** – Most phones include photo and video capabilities\n- **GPS** – Location services and mapping\n- **Touchscreen** – Most modern phones use a touch-based interface\n\n## Evolution\n1. **1G (1980s)** – Basic analog voice calls\n2. **2G (1990s)** – Digital calls + SMS\n3. **3G (2000s)** – Mobile internet\n4. **4G ','{\"iteration\":1,\"supports_tools\":false,\"tool_call_count\":0,\"input_tokens\":\"[masked]\",\"output_tokens\":\"[masked]\"}','2026-09-02 08:20:41','2026-09-02 08:20:46'),(22,129,'trace_d786b8603402fc67','span_be8102831cc6ebf0',NULL,'context_retrieval','ERP Context Retrieval','ai_chat',NULL,'2026-09-02 08:21:25','2026-09-02 08:21:25',0,'success',NULL,NULL,'ERP and navigation context prepared.','[]','2026-09-02 08:21:25','2026-09-02 08:21:25'),(23,129,'trace_d786b8603402fc67','span_47c7f464450250b3',NULL,'knowledge_search','Knowledge Search','ai_chat',NULL,'2026-09-02 08:21:25','2026-09-02 08:21:25',0,'success',NULL,NULL,'No relevant company knowledge found.','{\"matches\":0}','2026-09-02 08:21:25','2026-09-02 08:21:25'),(24,129,'trace_d786b8603402fc67','span_275b6e2f88183056',NULL,'response_generation','Provider Response Generation','ai_chat',NULL,'2026-09-02 08:21:25','2026-09-02 08:21:29',0,'success',NULL,NULL,'Based on the ERP context I have, here are the **available modules** in this application:\n\n## 📦 Available ERP Modules\n\n### 🤖 AI\n- AI Assistant, model management, and provider configuration\n\n### 🛒 Procurement\n- Purchase requisitions, suppliers, RFQs, and purchase orders\n\n### 💰 Finance\n- Financial management, invoices, payments, and budgets\n\n### 👥 HRMS\n- Human resources, employees, attendance, and leave\n\n### 🤝 CRM\n- Customer relationship management, leads, clients, and deals\n\n### 🎫 Helpdesk\n- Support tickets, SLAs, and knowledge base\n\n### 📊 Reports & Analytics\n- Executive reports and business analytics\n\n### 💻 Assets\n- IT asset management and inventory\n\n### 📁 Projects\n- Project management overview and task tracking\n\n---\n\n**Note:** I can only see the *available* modules — I don\'t have real-time data on which ones are fully \"completed\" or their implementation status. For detailed information on module completion or configuration, you may want to check the **AI Management Center** or contact ','{\"iteration\":1,\"supports_tools\":false,\"tool_call_count\":0,\"input_tokens\":\"[masked]\",\"output_tokens\":\"[masked]\"}','2026-09-02 08:21:25','2026-09-02 08:21:29'),(25,130,'trace_a22c04ca6fba22f1','span_d01cbc0d6385d824',NULL,'context_retrieval','ERP Context Retrieval','ai_chat',NULL,'2026-09-02 10:08:02','2026-09-02 10:08:02',0,'success',NULL,NULL,'ERP and navigation context prepared.','[]','2026-09-02 10:08:02','2026-09-02 10:08:02'),(26,130,'trace_a22c04ca6fba22f1','span_283c87d55c5e63df',NULL,'knowledge_search','Knowledge Search','ai_chat',NULL,'2026-09-02 10:08:02','2026-09-02 10:08:02',0,'success',NULL,NULL,'No relevant company knowledge found.','{\"matches\":0}','2026-09-02 10:08:02','2026-09-02 10:08:02'),(27,130,'trace_a22c04ca6fba22f1','span_7c3d3f2f3185dd55',NULL,'response_generation','Provider Response Generation','ai_chat